### ==============================================================================
### ShopCraft API - Day 05: Testing Pyramid HTTP Verification
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Create Product (Valid Payload - Expect 201 Created & Location Header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-TST-8001",
  "name": "Testing Pyramid Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Validated across unit, slice, and integration tests",
  "price": 179.99,
  "stockQuantity": 35,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2. Validation Failure (Blank Name & Negative Price - Expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-TST-8002",
  "name": "",
  "price": -49.99,
  "stockQuantity": -10,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 3. Sku Validation Failure (Invalid Regex - Expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "invalid_sku_format",
  "name": "Invalid SKU Item",
  "price": 29.99,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 4. Fetch Product by ID (Expect 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 5. Fetch Non-Existent Product (Expect 404 Not Found ProblemDetail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/99999

### 6. Filter Products (Dynamic Query Tested in DataJpa Slice)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?minPrice=100.00&maxPrice=200.00&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=5

### 7. Query Admin Audit Trail (Verifying E2E Event Recording)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?page=0&size=10
